corrected = ["code blocks retain the text scale", "heading anchors remain visible", "search filters wrap within a scrollable region", "landing sections retain their layout space", "assistant conversation focus keeps its outline", "responsive tables stay within a bounded scroll region for keyboard focus", "landscape search keeps its filters, results and footer in separate bounded rows", "illustration stages reserve their token height and draw independently of scrolling", "loading assistant focus stays within the active conversation"]
